<speak>A shared filing habit can reduce that dependence without putting every detail into a complicated system. Even a simple index at the front of the household box could say where the correspondence, manuals and contact information are kept. For private banking papers, keep access appropriate to your own circumstances rather than placing them in a general family folder by default. We can talk about document organisation without bringing anyone else into this call. It's your appointment, and we can continue directly with you.</speak>